// Runtime test program for tests/test.c and the driver workloads.
title: Expressions
---
<<declare $n = 0 as number>>
<<declare $b = false as bool>>
<<declare $s = "salt" as string>>
<<declare $counter = 0 as number>>
<<set $n = (3 + 4) * 2 - 10 / 4>>
<<set $b = $n > 10 and not ($s == "wake") or false>>
<<set $s = "wake">>
<<set $n = $n % 5 + min(9, 2) + max(-1, 1) + round(2.5) + round(3.5) + floor(-1.5) + ceil(1.2) + inc(2) + dec(2.5) + int(-3.7) + decimal(4.25)>>
Result: {$n} {$b} {$s} #line:expr_result
===
title: Options
---
Prompt: choose #line:options_prompt
-> Always #line:opt_always
    Picked: always #line:picked_always
-> Sometimes <<if $n >= 2>> #line:opt_sometimes
    Picked: sometimes #line:picked_sometimes
-> Rare <<once>> #line:opt_rare
    Picked: rare #line:picked_rare
-> Hosted <<if host_flag(1)>> #line:opt_hosted
    Picked: hosted #line:picked_hosted
Done: options #line:options_done
===
title: Commands
---
<<sync_cmd 7>>
Between: commands #line:between_commands
<<async_cmd "pause">>
<<flag_cmd true>>
After: commands {host_number()} #line:after_commands
===
title: Loop
---
<<set $counter = $counter + 1>>
<<jump Loop>>
===
title: Recurse
---
<<detour Recurse>>
===
title: Empty
---
<<if false>>
-> Never <<if false>> #line:never
    Nope #line:nope
<<endif>>
===
